WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.800
Who is harmed.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:04.022
Every affected population.

00:00:04.022 --> 00:00:10.818
This page shows every population harmed by the institutional capture documented across two hundred and sixty pages.

00:00:10.818 --> 00:00:13.772
Veterans offered death instead of treatment.

00:00:13.772 --> 00:00:16.568
Immigrants credential-trapped into poverty.

00:00:16.568 --> 00:00:19.477
Elderly dying in failing long-term care.

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:22.988
Homeless pushed onto streets by financialized housing.

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:26.147
Children with no recourse when the system fails.

00:00:26.147 --> 00:00:30.579
Indigenous peoples with one hundred and fifty years of violated treaties.

00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:34.034
Mentally ill waiting months while the system offers death.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.590
Opioid victims killed by a supply the system created.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.988
Every Canadian whose pension captures them financially.

00:00:40.988 --> 00:00:42.988
No one is exempt.

00:00:42.988 --> 00:00:47.238
The system harms everyone — but it harms the most vulnerable first.
